# A transaction recorded on OP Sepolia, replayed from its bundle with no node: an
# orchestrator without debug info calls a logger without debug info and three contracts
# that have it. The call stack nests every call under its caller, names each from its own
# contract's debug info, and shows what each returned. Recorded with
# `soldb trace 0x1362ee… --backend replay --save-replay`.
# REQUIRES: soldb
# RUN: %soldb replay %{project_root}/test/fixtures/replay/process-order-sepolia.json --ethdebug-dir 0x6a85ebf0Eba5307943bDF27D02d198Bc64e9ffEd:TaxCalculator:%{project_root}/test/walnut_0x75964ba0087ff8ae69bd7c17c8c4db66bc0c8e75603f79de1265c61ddfd98f2e_1756985337815_2zvewt/0x6a85ebf0Eba5307943bDF27D02d198Bc64e9ffEd/debug --ethdebug-dir 0xbE734aD6434E16f6bE04706005faED6fD38eb2B2:ShippingManager:%{project_root}/test/walnut_0x75964ba0087ff8ae69bd7c17c8c4db66bc0c8e75603f79de1265c61ddfd98f2e_1756985337815_2zvewt/0xbE734aD6434E16f6bE04706005faED6fD38eb2B2/debug --ethdebug-dir 0xf776FF56e2400e31f3070c1ac70Ab80433B01823:PaymentProcessor:%{project_root}/test/walnut_0x75964ba0087ff8ae69bd7c17c8c4db66bc0c8e75603f79de1265c61ddfd98f2e_1756985337815_2zvewt/0xf776FF56e2400e31f3070c1ac70Ab80433B01823/debug 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: Contract: 0x59a714559b46c823d87986b5c5b7c630e2f5668d
# CHECK: Status: SUCCESS
# CHECK: Call Stack:
# CHECK-NEXT: ---
# CHECK-NEXT: #0 0x59a714559b46c823d87986b5c5b7c630e2f5668d::runtime_dispatcher
# CHECK-NEXT:   #1 0xdcdd1dd0ff17043f8bcd1ac9e5be20bbed4fac0a::0x41304fac
# CHECK-NEXT:   #2 TaxCalculator::calculateTax(uint256 value = 1000, string orderType = physical) at {{.*}}TaxCalculator.sol:7
# CHECK-NEXT:     #3 getBaseRate(string orderType) [internal] at {{.*}}TaxCalculator.sol:18
# CHECK-NEXT:       raw entry stack:
# CHECK-NEXT:       ← return (uint256 = 8)
# CHECK-NEXT:     ← return (uint256 = 80)
# CHECK-NEXT:   #4 0xdcdd1dd0ff17043f8bcd1ac9e5be20bbed4fac0a::0xfc8a475f
# CHECK-NEXT:   #5 ShippingManager::initiateShipping(address customer = 0x286af310ea3303c80ebe9a66f6998b21bd8c1c29, string method = express) at {{.*}}ShippingManager.sol:8
# CHECK-NEXT:     #6 estimateShipping(string method) [internal] at {{.*}}ShippingManager.sol:17
# CHECK-NEXT:       raw entry stack:
# CHECK-NEXT:       ← return (uint256 = 50)
# CHECK-NEXT:     ← return (uint256 = 50)
# CHECK-NEXT:   #7 0xdcdd1dd0ff17043f8bcd1ac9e5be20bbed4fac0a::0xfc8a475f
# CHECK-NEXT:   #8 PaymentProcessor::processPayment(address from = 0x286af310ea3303c80ebe9a66f6998b21bd8c1c29, uint256 amount = 1080) at {{.*}}PaymentProcessor.sol:7
# CHECK-NEXT:   #9 0xdcdd1dd0ff17043f8bcd1ac9e5be20bbed4fac0a::0xe4af64b1
# CHECK-NEXT:   ← return 0x{{0+}}438
# CHECK-NOT: Backtrace:

# Without debug info every call is an address and the selector it was called with.
# RUN: %soldb replay %{project_root}/test/fixtures/replay/process-order-sepolia.json 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=PLAIN %s

# PLAIN: Steps: 5257
# PLAIN: Call Stack:
# PLAIN-NEXT: ---
# PLAIN-NEXT: #0 0x59a714559b46c823d87986b5c5b7c630e2f5668d::runtime_dispatcher
# PLAIN-NEXT:   #1 0xdcdd1dd0ff17043f8bcd1ac9e5be20bbed4fac0a::0x41304fac
# PLAIN-NEXT:   #2 0x6a85ebf0eba5307943bdf27d02d198bc64e9ffed::0x55ec8a03
